mlxflow 0.8
1. Read Text   book.txt
2. Split       chunk_size=2000   text -> [text]
3. <each summarize_section>   [text] -> [text]
     1. Summarize   (input:1)   Ministral 3B; "one paragraph"
     2. Template                "## Section {index}\n\n{1}"
4. Summarize   Qwen3 8B; "One page, from these section summaries"
5. Save Text   book-summary.md
